DEFINE CLASS frmsearchheat AS form 
 	*< CLASSDATA: Baseclass="form" Timestamp="" Scale="" Uniqueid="" />

	*-- OBJECTDATA items order determines ZOrder / El orden de los items OBJECTDATA determina el ZOrder 
	*< OBJECTDATA: ObjPath="cmdselect" UniqueID="" Timestamp="" />
	*< OBJECTDATA: ObjPath="txtHeat" UniqueID="" Timestamp="" />
	*< OBJECTDATA: ObjPath="cmdSearchHeat" UniqueID="" Timestamp="" />
	*< OBJECTDATA: ObjPath="lblHeat" UniqueID="" Timestamp="" />
	*< OBJECTDATA: ObjPath="cmdReturn" UniqueID="" Timestamp="" />
	*< OBJECTDATA: ObjPath="grdStockLst" UniqueID="" Timestamp="" />

	*<DefinedPropArrayMethod>
		*m: findheat
		*p: nconnhandle
		*p: nreturn
	*</DefinedPropArrayMethod>

	*<PropValue>
		Icon = graphics\earth.ico
		Caption = "Search by HEAT"
		DataSession = 2
		DoCreate = .T.
		Height = 245
		Left = 0
		Name = "frmSearchHeat"
		nconnhandle = 0
		nreturn = 0
		Top = 0
		Width = 561
		WindowType = 1
	*</PropValue>

	ADD OBJECT 'cmdReturn' AS commandbutton WITH ;
		Caption = "Quit", ;
		Height = 27, ;
		Left = 468, ;
		Name = "cmdReturn", ;
		Top = 4, ;
		Width = 84
		*< END OBJECT: BaseClass="commandbutton" />

	ADD OBJECT 'cmdSearchHeat' AS commandbutton WITH ;
		Caption = "Find", ;
		Height = 27, ;
		Left = 161, ;
		Name = "cmdSearchHeat", ;
		TabIndex = 3, ;
		Top = 4, ;
		Width = 84
		*< END OBJECT: BaseClass="commandbutton" />

	ADD OBJECT 'cmdselect' AS commandbutton WITH ;
		Caption = "Select", ;
		Height = 27, ;
		Left = 372, ;
		Name = "cmdselect", ;
		Top = 4, ;
		Width = 84
		*< END OBJECT: BaseClass="commandbutton" />

	ADD OBJECT 'grdStockLst' AS grid WITH ;
		Height = 192, ;
		Left = 12, ;
		Name = "grdStockLst", ;
		Top = 48, ;
		Width = 540
		*< END OBJECT: BaseClass="grid" />

	ADD OBJECT 'lblHeat' AS label WITH ;
		AutoSize = .T., ;
		Caption = "HEAT", ;
		Height = 17, ;
		Left = 14, ;
		Name = "lblHeat", ;
		TabIndex = 1, ;
		Top = 10, ;
		Width = 33
		*< END OBJECT: BaseClass="label" />

	ADD OBJECT 'txtHeat' AS textbox WITH ;
		Alignment = 0, ;
		Height = 23, ;
		Left = 53, ;
		Name = "txtHeat", ;
		TabIndex = 2, ;
		Top = 6, ;
		Value = , ;
		Width = 100
		*< END OBJECT: BaseClass="textbox" />
	
	PROCEDURE findheat
		PARAMETERS pHeat
		
		
		IF TYPE("pHeat") = "C"
			IF NOT EMPTY( ALLTRIM( pHeat ))	
				ThisForm.grdStockLst.RecordSource = ""
				
				PRIVATE cHeat
				cHeat = ALLTRIM( pHeat )
				cHeat = STRTRAN(cHeat,"'","")
				cHeat = STRTRAN(cHeat,["],"")
		
				PRIVATE cSQL,nSQLEXEC
				
		*		cSQL = "SELECT 'T' as [Current], ' ' as [WHO], ' ' as [WHAT], GetDate() as [WHEN], *, 0 as [ID_History] FROM dbo.StockLst_Master "
		*		cSQL = cSQL + " WHERE HEAT LIKE '%" + cHeat + "%'"
		*		cSQL = cSQL + " UNION SELECT 'F' as [Current], * FROM dbo.Ar_Stocklst_Master_History"
		*		cSQL = cSQL + " WHERE HEAT LIKE '%" + cHeat + "%'"
				*cSQL = cSQL = " AND [WHAT] = 'DELETE'"
		*		cSQL = cSQL + " ORDER BY Alloy,Form,cc,Size,Heat,[Current],[What] "
		
				cSQL = "SELECT "
				cSQL = cSQL + " [WHO],[What],[When]"
				cSQL = cSQL + " ,[ID]"
				cSQL = cSQL + " ,[Alloy]"
				cSQL = cSQL + " ,[Form]"
				cSQL = cSQL + " ,[lot]"
				cSQL = cSQL + " ,[Paid]"
				cSQL = cSQL + " ,[stkdate]"
				cSQL = cSQL + " ,[PO_item]"
				cSQL = cSQL + " ,[PODueDate]"
				cSQL = cSQL + " ,[history]"
				cSQL = cSQL + " ,[mill]"
		
				cSQL = cSQL + " ,[size]"
				cSQL = cSQL + " ,[cc]"
				cSQL = cSQL + " ,[cond]"
				cSQL = cSQL + " ,[mWeight]"
				cSQL = cSQL + " ,[specs]"
		
				cSQL = cSQL + " ,[BrandName]"
				cSQL = cSQL + " ,[FROM_ID]"
		
				cSQL = cSQL + " ,[ID_History]"
				cSQL = cSQL + " ,[mS_QTY]"
				cSQL = cSQL + " ,[WO_Detail]"
				cSQL = cSQL + " ,[ProjID]"
		      
				cSQL = cSQL + " FROM dbo.StockLst_Master_union WITH(NOLOCK) "
				cSQL = cSQL + " WHERE HEAT LIKE '%" + cHeat + "%'"
				cSQL = cSQL + " ORDER BY ID, Alloy, Form, CC, Size, Heat, What"
				
				
				IF USED("tStockLst_SQL")
					USE IN tStockLst_SQL
				ENDIF
		
				SELECT 0
		
				nSQLEXEC = SQLEXEC(ThisForm.nConnHandle, cSQL, 'tStockLst_SQL')
				DO WHILE nSQLEXEC = 0
					WAIT WINDOW 'SQL' TIMEOUT 1
					nSQLEXEC = SQLEXEC(ThisForm.nConnHandle, cSQL, 'tStockLst_SQL')
				ENDDO
				IF nSQLEXEC < 0 &&Try again!
					nSQLEXEC = SQLEXEC(ThisForm.nConnHandle, cSQL, "tStockLst_SQL")
					DO WHILE nSQLEXEC = 0
						WAIT WINDOW 'SQL 2' TIMEOUT 1
						nSQLEXEC = SQLEXEC(ThisForm.nConnHandle, cSQL, "tStockLst_SQL")
						
						IF nSQLEXEC < 0
							IF MESSAGEBOX("SQL FAILED!"+CHR(13)+"Do you want to try again?",4+48,"ERROR") = 6
								nSQLEXEC = 0
							ENDIF
						ENDIF
					ENDDO
				ENDIF 
				IF nSQLEXEC < 1
					SQLEXECError(cSQL,ThisForm.nConnHandle, nSQLEXEC, 'tStockLst_SQL')
				ELSE
					SELECT tStockLst_SQL	
					ThisForm.grdStockLst.RecordSource = "tStockLst_SQL"
					ThisForm.grdStockLst.Refresh
					
				ENDIF
			ENDIF
		ENDIF
	ENDPROC

	PROCEDURE Init
		PARAMETERS pHeat
		
		
		IF TYPE("pHeat") = "C"
			IF NOT EMPTY(pHeat)
				ThisForm.txtHeat.Value = pHeat
				ThisForm.FindHeat( This.txtHeat.Value )
			ELSE
				ThisForm.txtHeat.SetFocus
			ENDIF
		ELSE
			ThisForm.txtHeat.SetFocus
		ENDIF
			
		
			
	ENDPROC

	PROCEDURE Load
		IF NOT "PROC_SQL" $ SET("PROCEDURE")  &&Added for when Quotes is run without ERP menu.
			SET PROCEDURE TO Progs\Proc_SQL ADDITIVE
		ENDIF
		
		ThisForm.nConnHandle = get_SQLSTRINGCONNECT()
		
		
		IF NOT "Proc_ERP" $ UPPER( SET("PROCEDURE") )	
			SET PROCEDURE TO Progs\Proc_ERP ADDITIVE
		ENDIF
		
		IF ThisForm.nConnHandle < 0
			= MESSAGEBOX('Cannot make connection', 16, 'SQL Connect Error')
			QUIT
		ENDIF
	ENDPROC

	PROCEDURE Unload
		IF USED("tStockLst_SQL")
			USE IN tStockLst_SQL
		ENDIF
		
		RETURN ThisForm.nReturn
	ENDPROC

	PROCEDURE cmdReturn.Click
		PRIVATE dReturnDate
		
		ThisForm.nReturn = 0
		
		ThisForm.Release
		
	ENDPROC

	PROCEDURE cmdSearchHeat.Click
		ThisForm.FindHeat( This.Parent.txtHeat.Value )
		*ThisForm.grdStockLst.SetFocus()
	ENDPROC

	PROCEDURE cmdselect.Click
		PRIVATE nID
		
		nID = tStockLst_SQL.ID
		IF TYPE("nID") = "N"
			ThisForm.nReturn = nID
		ENDIF
		
		ThisForm.Release
		
	ENDPROC

	PROCEDURE txtHeat.Valid
		IF LEN(ALLTRIM(This.Value)) > 0
			This.Parent.cmdSearchHeat.Click
		*	ThisForm.grdStockLst.SetFocus()
		ENDIF
	ENDPROC

ENDDEFINE
